<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>03 · 应用与交付</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活 · 第 5 周综合答辩</Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 6 }}>三端交付：谁看、看什么、怎么看</Text>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 10, marginBottom: 18 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, width: '100%', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 30 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 366, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src="assets/superset.png" style={{ width: 366, height: 210, objectFit: 'cover', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 12 }}>Superset 仪表板</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>3 数据源、10 数据集、8 张图，含中国地图与月份筛选器；分析人员可自助拖拽。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 366, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src="assets/wall.png" style={{ width: 366, height: 210, objectFit: 'cover', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 12 }}>ECharts 数据大屏</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>7 面板 5 类图表，1920×1080 固定舞台 + 整体缩放；接口不通时回落内联快照。</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ width: 366, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Image src="assets/qa.png" style={{ width: 366, height: 210, objectFit: 'cover', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 12 }}>Streamlit 智能问答</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>提问 → 生成 SQL → 校验 → 执行 → 出表出图，界面上能看见它改过哪一次。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, padding: '14px 20px', background: '#E8EFF8', borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>
                三端读的是同一份 ADS 数据：仪表板 GMV、大屏 GMV、接口 GMV 全部等于 36,116,687.06——<b>前端不各自算数</b>。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 16, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>云购生活数据仓库项目组</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>11</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
